  "problem": "Suppose $|\\,m\\,|=12$ and the angle between vectors $m$ and $n$ is $\\theta =\\frac{\\pi }{4}.$ Find the scalar projection of $m$ onto $n.$\n\n${\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,m=$\n{{field-1}}",
